  <string name="new_mechanics" formatted="false">05 / RISK AND REWARD</string>
  <string name="new_mechanics_body" formatted="false">Graze a meteor without touching it to earn points and energy. Chain near misses within 5 seconds. Combos 3 and 6 give ×2 and ×3 bonuses. Armor hits or timeout break the combo. Time and item points are not multiplied.</string>
  <string name="pulse_help" formatted="false">06 / ENERGY PULSE</string>
  <string name="pulse_help_body" formatted="false">At full energy, pulse clears meteors within radius 180 and protects for 0.6 seconds. Start with full energy; recharge 3/second, 12 per near miss and 20 per item. Destroyed meteors give no near-miss points.</string>
  <string name="wave_help" formatted="false">07 / WARNINGS</string>
  <string name="wave_help_body" formatted="false">From second 12, a shower arrives every 18 seconds with 1.6 seconds of warning. Orange marks danger; cyan marks the shower gap. Older meteors may still occupy it. After 20 seconds, some meteors drift sideways.</string>
  <string name="mission_help" formatted="false">08 / FLIGHT OBJECTIVES</string>
  <string name="mission_help_body" formatted="false">Survive 30 seconds: +100 points. Graze 5 meteors: +150. Collect 3 items: +100. Each objective pays once, even when not displayed. Final credits include all bonus points.</string>
  <string name="challenge_title" formatted="false">FLY WITH A PURPOSE</string>
  <string name="challenge_body" formatted="false">Survive 30 seconds · 5 near misses · 3 items. Complete all three for 350 bonus points per flight.</string>
  <string name="flight_upgrade_title" formatted="false">IN-FLIGHT UPGRADES</string>
  <string name="flight_upgrade_body" formatted="false">Choose one change for the rest of this flight. Time is frozen while you decide. Each type can be chosen once.</string>
  <string name="flight_upgrade_choose" formatted="false">Choose and continue</string>
  <string name="capacitor_body" formatted="false">Amplifier: pulse radius 180 → 250. Tradeoff: passive energy recharge is 30% slower. Item and near-miss energy stay unchanged.</string>
  <string name="daredevil_body" formatted="false">Daredevil: double near-miss points. Tradeoff: maximum armor −1; current armor is capped at the new maximum.</string>
  <string name="focus_body" formatted="false">Focus: combo window 5 → 8 seconds. Tradeoff: newly collected slow items last 20% less time.</string>
  <string name="flight_upgrade_help" formatted="false">At 45, 90 and 135 seconds, pause to choose an upgrade for this flight only; each type once. A 3-second countdown follows. Amplifier: wider pulse, slower recharge. Daredevil: double near-miss points, less armor. Focus: longer combos, shorter slow effects.</string>
  <string name="guide_pickup" formatted="false">STEP 2 / 4 · Drag into an item for effects and energy.</string>
  <string name="guide_pulse" formatted="false">STEP 3 / 4 · Use PULSE at full energy to clear a path.</string>
  <string name="guide_near" formatted="false">STEP 4 / 4 · Let a meteor pass close without touching the ship to earn a combo.</string>
